  "summary": "Nautical interior design aesthetic is a classic architectural style that mimics the timeless, crisp atmosphere of coastal life and sea-faring ships.",
  "description": "Nautical interior design aesthetic is a classic architectural style that mimics the timeless, crisp atmosphere of coastal life and sea-faring ships. It is heavily characterized by a white and navy blue palette, prevalent use of weathered woods, crisp stripes, and authentic maritime artifacts. Unlike broader coastal styles that leans on generally on nautical, beach-like relaxation design specifically evokes a yacht-club, elegance or a rugged sailor's charm.",
